{"title":"죽은 자들의 이야기 -이스토리아-","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:Asl4yHd38HSdTRkL7ybg","sourceHash":"1c2e2fd4029ffe821d0805b381ba337b34595ce6cba076c87c8b64b220ed30fa","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":31.27,"end":34.269999999999996,"text":"旅人よ お前の背には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":35.27,"end":38.27,"text":"黒き闇 死が纏う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":39.23,"end":42.23,"text":"残された 季節も知らず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":42.8,"end":45.8,"text":"風よ 何処へと吹くのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.04,"end":47.3,"text":"【一方その頃】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":47.3,"end":50.3,"text":"【東方防衛同盟に参加したアルカディア軍は】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.33,"end":53.33,"text":"【女王アレクサンドラ率いる女傑部隊と戦端を開いていた】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":55.03,"end":58.03,"text":"運命よ お前の手には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":58.75,"end":61.75,"text":"白き糸 音に揺られ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":62.74,"end":65.74000000000001,"text":"紡がれた 所以も知らず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":66.41,"end":69.41,"text":"我は 何故に征くのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":69.56,"end":69.99,"text":"【一方その頃】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":69.99,"end":72.99,"text":"「私の負けだ さあ、殺すがいい！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":75.36,"end":78.36,"text":"「このレオンティウス、女を貫く槍は 持ってはおらぬ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":79.69,"end":82.58,"text":"「気に入ったぞ、レオンティウス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":82.58,"end":85.58,"text":"いずれお前は私のものになるのだ。忘れるなっ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":86.95,"end":89.95,"text":"【尚も戦火は世界を駈け廻り】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":89.98,"end":92.25,"text":"【翻弄される者達】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":92.25,"end":94.72999999999999,"text":"【それぞれの季節が過ぎてゆく】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":94.72999999999999,"end":96.12,"text":"嗚於 懐かしき故郷よ(おお、アルカディア)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":96.12,"end":98.18,"text":"遥けき 面影","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":98.18,"end":101.18,"text":"あの稜線は 今も燃えている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":101.78,"end":104.78,"text":"秋が廻れば 兄妹 また双り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":106.15,"end":109.15,"text":"憶い出すのでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":110.16,"end":113.16,"text":"夕陽に 潜む闇が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":113.16,"end":116.16,"text":"今も 紅く胸を抉る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":117.75,"end":118.7,"text":"嗚呼 茜空よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":118.7,"end":121.7,"text":"人間は 何に従うべきで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":122.16,"end":125.16,"text":"何を探すべきなのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":141.22,"end":144.22,"text":"背中で 聴いていた 鼓動","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":145.38,"end":148.38,"text":"今でも 憶えてる 旋律","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":149.34,"end":152.34,"text":"よく似た 星を抱いてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":153.07999999999998,"end":156.07999999999998,"text":"君を 何時も 傍に感じてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":157.02,"end":160.02,"text":"「さよなら」 言ってない[だろ／もの]","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":160.75,"end":163.75,"text":"また [僕らは／二人は] 出逢えるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":165.13,"end":168.13,"text":"何処かで 双星を見てる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":169.01,"end":171.37,"text":"君を 現在も 傍に感じてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":171.37,"end":173.76,"text":"泣き虫だった 兄","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":173.76,"end":176.76,"text":"【少年が剣を取るならば】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":177.06,"end":180.02,"text":"お転婆だった 妹","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":180.02,"end":183.02,"text":"【少女は楯を取るのだろうか?】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":183.07,"end":186.07,"text":"【廻る廻る 運命の回転木馬】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":189.33,"end":192.33,"text":"【物語は幾つかの地平を廻り続ける】","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":210.69,"end":213.69,"text":"「あんな売女の ブロンディスに連なる血がそれほど大事か","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":216.32999999999998,"end":219.32999999999998,"text":"レオンティウス 貴様さえ生まれてこなければ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":220.62,"end":223.62,"text":"ふふふ 妾腹と蔑むなら蔑むがいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":225.38,"end":228.38,"text":"世界の王になるのはこの、私だ！ふははははっ！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":230.1,"end":233.1,"text":"手を伸ばし 掴んだ筈の宝石は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":237.7,"end":240.7,"text":"掌から 零れ落ちるものばかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":245.72,"end":248.72,"text":"奪い合い 憎み合い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":249.12,"end":252.12,"text":"血を流し続けるのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":253.43,"end":256.43,"text":"戦に 明け暮れる 世界よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":265.11,"end":268.11,"text":"我等は今 何と戦うべきで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":269.6,"end":272.6,"text":"何を守るべきか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":272.86,"end":274.15999999999997,"text":"嗚呼 星空よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":274.15999999999997,"end":277.15999999999997,"text":"人間は 何を畏れるべきで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":277.54,"end":280.54,"text":"何を愛すべきなのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":281.21,"end":284.21,"text":"滅びへ 向かう光よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":284.28,"end":287.28,"text":"全ての 死すべき者達よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":288.51,"end":289.52,"text":"嗚於 同胞よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":289.52,"end":292.52,"text":"人間は 何を育むべきで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":293.35,"end":296.35,"text":"何を遺すべきなのか?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":297.95,"end":300.95,"text":"いずれ 歴史は語るだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":301.51,"end":304.51,"text":"【死せる者達の物語】を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}